    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis is an excellent three-bedroom semi-detached property with private driveway parking and side entrance leading to a sunny, enclosed rear garden. The property is ideally located in a mature and quiet cul-de-sac development, within easy walking distance of all that Skerries has to offer. \n\nThe property is presented in good condition throughout. The accommodation briefly comprises a front porch, entrance hall, a bright living room with wood-burning stove, kitchen/dining room with access to rear garden. Upstairs, the accommodation includes a family bathroom along with three bedrooms. Two of the bedrooms are double rooms with built-in wardrobes, while the third is a single bedroom with a built-in storage press. There is also Stira access to the attic space.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from private driveway parking, mature front garden with a side entrance to the rear garden. The rear garden itself is a private, enclosed mature space featuring a combination of mature planting, lawn and patio area, along with the added benefit of a block-built garden shed.\n\nMill Hill Park enjoys a prime and highly sought-after location, within walking distance of the excellent amenities and transport links available in Skerries. The adjacent park offers an array of recreational facilities including tennis courts, football pitches, an all-weather playing field, a wildlife area, the Mills Heritage Centre and café, a skate park, and extensive open green space. The park also provides safe, traffic-free access to local primary schools, shops and the town centre. The beach and Skerries railway station are conveniently located approximately 700 metres from the property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.90m x 0.53m\n\n\nEntrance Hall - 1.90m x 3.62m\nWith wooden flooring and under stair storage.\n\nLiving Room - 3.27m x 4.48m\nWith wooden flooring, feature fireplace with tiled hearth and wood burning stove.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 5.26m x 3.74m\nSpacious open plan kitchen/ dining area with laminate flooring, fully fitted kitchen with floor and wall mounted units, tiled splash back, plumbed for washing machine and dish washer, sliding door to rear garden.\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nLanding - 1.90m x 2.95m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.27m x 4.18m\nWith wooden laminate flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.27m x 3.28m\nWith carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.17m x 2.76m\nWith carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.90m x 2.17m\nWith tiled floor and part tiled walls, walk in shower, W.C & W.H.B with storage and wall mounted medicine cabinet.\n\nOutside - \nPrivate off street driveway parking with front garden laid in lawn and mature shrubbery. Side entrance leads to gated, enclosed mature rear garden patio area, lawn, mature planting and block-built garden shed.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
